abstract: >-
  Workforce Planning Management (WPM): a demonstration all-in-one HR
  platform covering the employee lifecycle hire to retire — talent
  acquisition and onboarding, workforce management, HR service
  delivery, talent management and development, and payroll and
  compensation. A Rust/Loco (Axum + SeaORM + PostgreSQL) back-end JSON
  API and a SvelteKit 2 / Svelte 5 front-end.
